              "anchorId": "ac-2-exact-bytes",
              "claim": "`docs/archive/wakeflow-smoke-round5.md` 的内容逐字节等于 `Wakeflow joint test round 5` 后接一个 LF，共 28 字节。",
              "probe": "`wc -c < docs/archive/wakeflow-smoke-round5.md`；`shasum -a 256 docs/archive/wakeflow-smoke-round5.md`；`printf 'Wakeflow joint test round 5\\n' | cmp - docs/archive/wakeflow-smoke-round5.md; echo $?`；`od -c docs/archive/wakeflow-smoke-round5.md`。",
              "expected": "`wc -c` 输出 28；SHA-256 为 `ed5d57c57980cbaa857c45c3e5b51c669068a1df5fd56f9f5ef233b41e0a9521`；`cmp` 没有差异输出且退出码为 0；`od -c` 首字节是 `W`，唯一的换行是最后一个字节 `\\n`，没有 `\\r`。",
              "requirementRef": {
